 "validity": "<b>Validity of Quotation:</b> This quotation is valid for 24 hours from the date of issue and is subject to hotel and room availability as no space has been secured. A deposit of RM 250 per person is required upon confirmation, with full payment due 45 days prior to arrival. A late booking surcharge of RM 50 per booking applies to bookings made less than 45 days before the departure date. Prices are quoted for 2 to 3 persons per room; a triple room uses an extra bed subject to availability. Boat and activity transfers are on a sharing basis (seat-in-coach) with other tourists; private transportation applies on Day 1 and the final day only. Private transportation and tour guide are based on a 10 hours basis per day; additional hours are charged by the operator and payable in cash. Peak season surcharge applies as stated and is not included in the base price. Itinerary, price and flight schedule are subject to change. Final itinerary and hotel arrangements will be confirmed at least 15 days before the trip. This package is valid for travel until 31 December 2026; 2027 travel dates are quoted using the 2026 catalogue rate plus the published 2027 peak season surcharge and are subject to reconfirmation. Ground arrangement and tipping only - flight tickets are not included.",
